  "description": "Dependency-light key-store and envelope encryption for the Stratara framework. Production IKeyStore implementation (EnvelopeFileKeyStore) with KEK-wrapped, versioned per-scope DEKs (rotation + revoke + crypto-shred), a file-backed master-key provider, and an AES-GCM blob encryptor with purpose-bound associated data. References only Stratara.Abstractions + BCL crypto — no EF Core, RabbitMQ, Redis, or cloud SDKs.",
